  "insights": [
    {
      "title": "Delivery reliability crisis erodes trust",
      "kind": "pain_point",
      "theme_id": "amazon-t23",
      "body": "Late or lost deliveries represent the largest volume of complaints with 8,436 mentions, showing a 75.5% growth rate and an 89.5% negative sentiment share [#tk_2791958] [#tk_2974902]. Customers report packages being left in insecure locations or marked as delivered when they are missing, leading to significant frustration and financial loss [#tk_2853668] [#tk_2279049]."
    },
    {
      "title": "Prime speed degradation drives churn risk",
      "kind": "pain_point",
      "theme_id": "amazon-t6",
      "body": "Prime delivery speed degradation affects 4,287 users with a 67.5% growth rate and 88% negative sentiment, undermining the core value proposition of the subscription [#tk_2868365] [#tk_2693909]. Users specifically cite delays from specific facilities like Hillsboro, OR, where 2-day promises are consistently missed, causing long-time members to feel betrayed [#tk_457683] [#tk_2061568]."
    },
    {
      "title": "Refund delays and damage disputes spike",
      "kind": "pain_point",
      "theme_id": "amazon-t5",
      "body": "Order damage and refund requests have surged by 99.3% to 3,303 mentions, with 45.5% negative sentiment, indicating a breakdown in post-purchase resolution [#tk_2980905] [#tk_2141361]. Customers report waiting weeks for refunds after returns or receiving gift certificates for lost items, often requiring multiple escalations to resolve [#tk_2830780] [#tk_673109]."
    },
    {
      "title": "Customer service responsiveness is failing",
      "kind": "pain_point",
      "theme_id": "amazon-t31",
      "body": "Poor customer service experiences have grown by 68.4% to 1,020 mentions, with a severe 95.3% negative sentiment share, signaling a critical gap in support quality [#tk_2539680] [#tk_2830780]. Users describe hours spent on calls with no resolution and unresponsive email support, particularly for complex issues like lost packages or billing errors [#tk_2980905] [#tk_2151044]."
    }
  ]
